    "name": "Salesforce discount approval",
    "description": "A Salesforce Flow posts the Opportunity Id when a rep submits a discount; the opportunity and its products are read, the Discount tiers table decides who approves, the sales manager and then finance approve or reject, and the status is written back to the opportunity.",
